**🔴 Security: Missing DeeplinkPath.firstLogin case in switch statement**

**File:** `lib/core/services/deeplink/deeplink_service.dart` **Line:** 48

The deeplink service does not include the 'DeeplinkPath.firstLogin' case that was mentioned in the MR description. This path should handle first-time registration password setup via deeplink. Without this case, the deeplink routing for password setup will fail, breaking a core requirement of JIRA ISB-2952.

**Current Code:**
```dart
switch (path) {
  case DeeplinkPath.pendingPayment:
  // ... other cases
  default:
    break;
}
```

**Suggested Fix:**
```dart
switch (path) {
  case DeeplinkPath.pendingPayment:
  // ... other cases
  case DeeplinkPath.firstLogin:
    final token = deeplink.decodedQueryParam(ParamKey.token);
    _navigateToNewPassword(token);
    break;
  default:
    break;
}

static void _navigateToNewPassword(String? token) {
  if (token == null || token.isEmpty) {
    // Log error or show error message
    return;
  }

  if (Get.isRegistered<DashboardController>()) {
    Get.find<DashboardController>().startSetNewPasswordFlow(token: token);
  } else {
    // Navigate directly if DashboardController not registered
    Get.toNamed(AppRoute.newPassword, arguments: {ArgumentResource.token: token});
  }
}
```

**Recommendation:** Add the missing DeeplinkPath.firstLogin case to the switch statement in _routingDeeplink method. Also add proper token validation before navigation and handle the case when DashboardController is not registered.

---
🤖 Automated review by Claude Code

**🔴 JIRA Alignment: Missing firstLogin deeplink path constant**

**File:** `lib/core/constants/deeplink_path.dart` **Line:** 34

The DeeplinkPath class does not contain a constant for 'firstLogin' path which is required for the password setup feature. This will cause compilation errors when the deeplink service tries to reference DeeplinkPath.firstLogin.

**Current Code:**
```dart
class DeeplinkPath {
  static const String pendingPayment = "/pending_payment";
  // ... other paths
  static const String locationInsight = "/location_insight";
}
```

**Suggested Fix:**
```dart
class DeeplinkPath {
  static const String pendingPayment = "/pending_payment";
  // ... other paths
  static const String locationInsight = "/location_insight";
  static const String firstLogin = "/first_login";
}
```

**Recommendation:** Add the missing 'firstLogin' constant to the DeeplinkPath class to support deeplink navigation to the password setup page.

---
🤖 Automated review by Claude Code

**🔴 JIRA Alignment: Missing newPassword route constant**

**File:** `lib/app/app_routes.dart` **Line:** 44

The AppRoute class does not include a route constant for the new password screen. This is essential for navigation to the password setup page and was mentioned in the MR description as being added.

**Current Code:**
```dart
class AppRoute {
  AppRoute._();
  static const String loading = '/loading';
  // ... other routes
  static const String otp = '/otp';
}
```

**Suggested Fix:**
```dart
class AppRoute {
  AppRoute._();
  static const String loading = '/loading';
  // ... other routes
  static const String otp = '/otp';
  static const String newPassword = '/new-password';
}
```

**Recommendation:** Add the 'newPassword' route constant to support navigation to the new password setup screen.

