The deeplink service does not include the 'DeeplinkPath.firstLogin' case that was mentioned in the MR description. This path should handle first-time registration password setup via deeplink. Without this case, the deeplink routing for password setup will fail, breaking a core requirement of JIRA ISB-2952.

