The handleUriDeeplink method includes a hardcoded 1-second delay with 'await Future.delayed(const Duration(seconds: 1))'. This delay is arbitrary and could cause poor UX. There's no comment explaining why this delay is necessary. If it's to wait for app initialization, there should be a proper state check instead.

